template &lt;typename ntype, int NT&gt;: type and size are parameters (N8, plus an integer parameter): pmatrixq&lt;double,3&gt;, pmatrixq&lt;float,2&gt;, … Inside the class, pmatrixq alone means pmatrixq&lt;ntype,NT&gt;.
